#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customizing &kde; software"
msgstr "Prilagođavanje &kde; softvera"

#. Tag: author
#: config.docbook:7 config.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid "&TC.Hollingsworth; &TC.Hollingsworth.mail;"
msgstr "&TC.Hollingsworth; &TC.Hollingsworth.mail;"

#. Tag: trans_comment
#: config.docbook:8 config.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROLES_OF_TRANSLATORS"
msgstr "ULOGE_PREVODILACA"

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customizing Toolbars"
msgstr "Prilagođavanje alatnih traka"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: config.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &gwenview; Toolbar"
msgstr "&gwenview; Alatna traka"

#. Tag: phrase
#: config.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &gwenview; toolbar."
msgstr "&gwenview; alatna traka."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The toolbar in <ulink url=\"http://kde.org/applications/graphics/gwenview/"
"\">&gwenview;</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Alatna traka na <ulink url=\"http://kde.org/applications/graphics/gwenview/"
"\">&gwenview;</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modifying Toolbar Items"
msgstr "Modificiranje stavki alatne trake"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To customize an application's toolbars, go to <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or "
"right-click on a toolbar and select <guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars...</"
"guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste prilagodili alatne trake aplikacije, idite na "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Prilagodi alatne trake..."
"</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili kliknite desnim klikom na alatnoj traci i "
"odaberite <guimenuitem>Prilagodi alatne trake...</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the left side of the toolbar configuration panel, the available items "
"that you can put in your toolbar are shown. On the right, the ones that "
"already appear on the toolbar are shown. At the top, you can select the "
"toolbar you wish to modify or view."
msgstr ""
"Na lijevoj strani panela konfiguraciju alatne trake, prikazane su dostupne "
"stavke koje možete staviti u alatnu traku. Na desnoj su prikazani oni koji "
"se već pojavljuju na alatnoj traci. Na vrhu, možete odabrati alatnu traku "
"koju želite modificirati ili vidjeti."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Above each side of the panel there is a <guilabel>Filter</guilabel> text box "
"you can use to easily find items in the list."
msgstr ""
"Iznad svake strane panela postoji <guilabel>Filter</guilabel> okvir za tekst "
"možete koristiti za jednostavno pronalaženje stavki na listi."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: config.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Customize Toolbars Window"
msgstr "Prilagođavanje alatnih traka Prozor"

#. Tag: phrase
#: config.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Customize Toolbars window."
msgstr "Prilagođavanje alatnih traka prozor."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Customize Toolbars window in &gwenview; with the <guibutton>Previous</"
"guibutton> button selected."
msgstr ""
"Prilagođavanje alatnih traka prozor u &gwenview; sa <guibutton>Prethodni</"
"guibutton> dugmetom selektovanim."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding an Item"
msgstr "Dodavanje stavke"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can add an item to your toolbar by selecting it from the left side and "
"clicking on the right arrow button."
msgstr ""
"Možete dodati stavke na alatnoj traci odabirom iz lijeve strane i klikom na "
"strelicu desno."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing an Item"
msgstr "Uklanjanje stavke"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can remove an item by selecting it and clicking the left arrow button."
msgstr "Možete ukloniti stavku odabirom i klikom na dugme sa strelicom lijevo."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "Changing the Position of Items"
msgstr "Mijenjanje položaja stavki"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change the position of the items by moving them lower or higher in "
"the list. To move items lower, press the down arrow button, while to move "
"items higher press the up arrow button. You can also change items' position "
"by dragging and dropping them."
msgstr ""
"Možete promijeniti položaj stavke pomijerajući ih gore ili dolje na listi. "
"Da biste pomjerili stavku dolje, pritisnite strelicu prema dolje, a za "
"pomicanje stavki prema gore pritisnite strelicu nagore. Također možete "
"promijeniti položaj stavke njihovim povlačenjem i ispuštanjem."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On horizontal toolbars, the item that's on top will be the one on the left. "
"On vertical toolbars, items are arranged as they appear in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Na horizontalnim alatnim trakama, stavku koja je na vrhu će biti na lijevoj "
"strani. Na vertikalnim alatnim trakama, stavke su raspoređene onako kako se "
"pojavljuju u alatnoj traci."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding a Separator"
msgstr "Dodavanje rastavljača"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can add separator lines between items by adding a <guilabel>--- "
"separator ---</guilabel> item to the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Možete dodati liniju rastavljača između stavki dodavanjem <guilabel>--- "
"separator ---</guilabel> stavke na alatnoj traci."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Restoring Defaults"
msgstr "Vraćanje na početne postavke"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can restore your toolbar to the way it was when you installed the "
"application by pressing the <guibutton>Defaults</guibutton> button at the "
"bottom of the window and then confirming your decision."
msgstr ""
"Možete vratite alatnu traku na postavke kakve su bile kada ste instalirali "
"aplikaciju pritiskom na <guibutton>Početne postavke</guibutton> dugme na dnu "
"prozora, a zatim potvrđivanjem svoje odluke."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "Changing Text and Icons"
msgstr "Mijenjanje teksta i ikona"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change the icon and text of individual toolbar items by selecting an "
"item and clicking either the <guibutton>Change Icon...</guibutton> or "
"<guibutton>Change Text...</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Možete promijeniti ikonu i tekst pojedinih stavki alatne trake odabirom "
"stavke i klikom bilo na <guibutton>Promijeni ikonu...</guibutton> ili "
"<guibutton>Promijeni tekst...</guibutton> dugme."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customizing Toolbar Appearance"
msgstr "Prilagođavanje izgleda alatne trake"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change the appearance of toolbars by right-clicking on a toolbar to "
"access it's context menu."
msgstr ""
"Možete promijeniti izgled alatne trake desnim klikom na alatnu traku da "
"pristupite njenom kontekstnom meniju."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "Text Position"
msgstr "Položaj teksta"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change the appearance of text on toolbars in the <guisubmenu>Text "
"Position</guisubmenu> submenu of a toolbar's context menu."
msgstr ""
"Možete promijeniti izgled teksta alatne trake u <guisubmenu>Položaj teksta</"
"guisubmenu> podmeniju kontekstnog izbornika alatne trake."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:118 config.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can choose from:"
msgstr "Možete birati između:"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Icons</guimenuitem> - only the icon for each toolbar item will "
"appear."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Ikone</guimenuitem> - samo će se pojaviti ikona za svaku stavku "
"alatne trake."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Text</guimenuitem> - only the text label for each toolbar item "
"will appear."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Tekst</guimenuitem> - samo će se pojaviti tekst za svaku stavku "
"alatne trake."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Text Alongside Icons</guimenuitem> - the text label will appear "
"to the right of each toolbar item's icon"
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Tekst pored ikona</guimenuitem> - tekst će se pojaviti desno od "
"ikone za svaku stavku na alatnoj traci"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Text Under Icons</guimenuitem> - the text label will appear "
"underneath each toolbar item's icon"
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Tekst ispod ikona</guimenuitem> - tekst će se pojaviti ispod "
"ikone za svaku stavku na alatnoj traci"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also show or hide text for individual toolbar items by right-"
"clicking on an item and checking or unchecking the item under <guilabel>Show "
"Text</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Također možete prikazati ili sakriti tekst za pojedine stavke na alatnoj "
"traci desnim klikom na stavku i uključivanjem ili isključivanjem stavku pod "
"<guilabel>Prikaži tekst</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "Icon Size"
msgstr "Veličina ikona"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change the size of toolbar items' icons by selecting "
"<guisubmenu>Icon Size</guisubmenu> from the toolbar's context menu."
msgstr ""
"Možete promijeniti veličinu ikona stavki alatne trake izborom "
"<guisubmenu>Veličina ikona</guisubmenu> iz kontekstnog izbornika trake s "
"alatima."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose from the following options: (each lists the icon size in "
"pixels)"
msgstr ""
"Možete birati između sljedećih opcija: (svaki navodi veličinu ikona u "
"pikselima)"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: config.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "Small (16x16)"
msgstr "Male (16x16)"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenuitem>Medium (22x22)</guimenuitem> [the default value]"
msgstr "<guimenuitem>Srednje (22x22)</guimenuitem> [početna vrijednost]"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: config.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "Large (32x32)"
msgstr "Velike (32x32)"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: config.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid "Huge (48x48)"
msgstr "Ogromne (48×48)"

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moving Toolbars"
msgstr "Pomijeranje alatnih traka"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to move toolbars, you must <quote>unlock</quote> them. To do so, "
"uncheck <guimenuitem>Lock Toolbar Positions</guimenuitem> from a toolbar's "
"context menu. To restore the lock, simply recheck this menu item."
msgstr ""
"Da biste pomjerili alatne trake, morate ih <quote>otključati</quote>. Da "
"biste to uradili, isključite <guimenuitem>Zaključaj položaje alatnih traka</"
"guimenuitem> iz kontekstnog izbornika alatne trake. Da biste ponovo "
"zaključali položaje alatnih traka, jednostavno uključite ovu stavku "
"izbornika."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change a toolbar's position from the <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> submenu of its context menu."
msgstr ""
"Možete promijeniti položaj alatne trake iz <guisubmenu>Orijentacija</"
"guisubmenu> podmenija njenog kontekstnog menija."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenuitem>Top</guimenuitem> [the default in many applications]"
msgstr "<guimenuitem>Vrh</guimenuitem> [početno u većini aplikacija]"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: config.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid "Left"
msgstr "Lijevo"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: config.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "Right"
msgstr "Desno"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: config.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "Dno"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also move a toolbar by clicking and holding onto the dotted line at "
"the left of horizontal toolbars or the top of vertical toolbars and dragging "
"it to your desired location."
msgstr ""
"Također možete pomjerati alatne trake klikom i držanjem na isprekidanu "
"liniju na lijevoj strani horizontalne alatne trake ili vrhu vertikalne "
"alatne trake i povlačenjem na željeno mjesto."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show/Hide Toolbars"
msgstr "Prikaži/Sakrij alatne trake"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If your application has only one toolbar, you can hide a toolbar by "
"deselecting <guimenuitem>Show Toolbar</guimenuitem> from either the "
"toolbar's context menu or the <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu. To restore "
"the toolbar, select <guimenuitem>Show Toolbar</guimenuitem> from the "
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu. Note that toolbars must be "
"<quote>unlocked</quote> to hide them from their context menu; see <xref "
"linkend=\"toolbars-appearance-move\"/> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Ako vaša aplikacija ima samo jednu alatnu traku, možete sakriti alatnu traku "
"deselektovanjem <guimenuitem>Prikaži alatnu traku</guimenuitem> bilo iz "
"kontekstnog izbornika na alatnoj traci ili na <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> "
"meniju. Da biste vratili alatnu traku, odaberite <guimenuitem>Prikaži alatnu "
"traku</guimenuitem> iz <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> menija. Primijetite da "
"alatne trake moraju biti <quote>otključane</quote> da biste ih sakrili od "
"njihovih kontekstnih menija; pogledajte <xref linkend=\"toolbars-appearance-"
"move\"/> za više informacija."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If your application has more than one toolbar, a submenu called "
"<guisubmenu>Toolbars Shown</guisubmenu> will appear in the context menu and "
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu instead of the above menu entry. From that "
"menu you may select individual toolbars to hide and show."
msgstr ""
"Ako vaša aplikacija ima više od jedne alatne trake, podmeni "
"zvan<guisubmenu>Prikazane alatne trake</guisubmenu> će se pojaviti u "
"kontekstnom izborniku i <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> meniju umjesto unosa "
"iznad izbornika. Od tog izbornika možete odabrati pojedinačne alatne trake "
"da se sakrije i prikažu."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:214 config.docbook:382
#, no-c-format
msgid "Thanks and Acknowledgments"
msgstr "Zahvale i Priznanja"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Thanks to an anonymous Google Code-In 2011 participant for writing much of "
"this section."
msgstr ""
"Zahvale anonimnim Google Code-In 2011 učesnicima za pisanje velikog dijela "
"ove sekcije."

#. Tag: author
#: config.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid "<firstname>Alexey</firstname> <surname>Subach</surname>"
msgstr "<firstname>Alexey</firstname> <surname>Subach</surname>"

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using and Customizing Shortcuts"
msgstr "Korištenje i Prilagođavanje Prečica"

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many &kde; applications allow you to configure keyboard shortcuts. To open "
"the standard keyboard shortcuts configuration panel, go to "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Mnoge &kde; aplikacije vam omogućavaju podešavanje prečice tipkovnice. Za "
"otvaranje panela standardne konfiguracije prečica tipkovnice, idite na "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Podesite prečice...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the Configure Shortcuts window, you will see a list of all the shortcuts "
"available in the current application. You can use the search box at the top "
"to search for the shortcut you want."
msgstr ""
"U Podesite prečice prozoru, vidjet ćete popis svih prečica na raspolaganju "
"unutar trenutne aplikacije. Možete koristiti okvir za pretraživanje na vrhu "
"da tražite prečice koje želite."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: config.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Customize Shortcuts Window"
msgstr "Prilagodba Prečice prozor"

#. Tag: phrase
#: config.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Customize Shortcuts window."
msgstr "Prilagodba Prečice prozor."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:256
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Searching for shortcuts with <userinput>file</userinput> in <ulink url="
"\"http://kde.org/applications/system/dolphin/\">&dolphin;</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Traženje prečice s <userinput>datoteka</userinput> u <ulink url=\"http://kde."
"org/applications/system/dolphin/\">&dolphin;</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid "Changing a Shortcut"
msgstr "Mijenjanje prečice"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To change a shortcut, first click on the name of a shortcut you want to "
"change. You will see a radio group where you can choose whether to set the "
"shortcut to its default value, or select a new shortcut for the selected "
"action. To set a new shortcut, choose <guilabel>Custom</guilabel> and click "
"on the button next to it. Then just type the shortcut you would like to use, "
"and your changes will be saved."
msgstr ""
"Za promjenu prečicu, prvo kliknite na ime prečice koju želite promijeniti. "
"Vidjet ćete radio grupu u kojoj možete odabrati da želite postaviti prečice "
"na početne vrijednosti, ili odaberati novu prečicu za izabranu akciju. Da "
"biste postavili novu prečicu izaberite <guilabel>Posebno</guilabel> i "
"kliknite na dugme pored njega. Onda samo upišite prečicu koju želite "
"koristiti, a vaša promjena će biti sačuvana."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: config.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setting a Shortcut"
msgstr "Postavljanje prečice"

#. Tag: phrase
#: config.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Customize Shortcuts window demonstrating how to set a shortcut."
msgstr "Prilagodba Prečice prozor pokazuje kako postaviti prečicu."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resetting Shortcuts"
msgstr "Vraćanje Prečica"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is a button at the bottom of the window, called <guibutton>Reset to "
"Defaults</guibutton>. Clicking on this button will reset all your custom "
"shortcuts to their default values."
msgstr ""
"Postoji dugme na dnu prozora, pod nazivom <guibutton>Vrati na početno</"
"guibutton>. Klikom na ovo dugme će vratiti sve vaše prilagođene prečice na "
"njihove početne vrijednosti."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also reset an individual shortcut to its default value by selecting "
"it, and choosing the <guilabel>Default</guilabel> radio button."
msgstr ""
"Također možete resetirati pojedinačnu prečicu na zadanu vrijednost izborom, "
"a zatim odabirom <guilabel>Početno</guilabel> radio dugmeta."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing a Shortcut"
msgstr "Uklanjanje Prečice"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove a shortcut, select it from the list, then click the remove icon (a "
"black arrow with a cross) to the right of the button that allows you to "
"select a shortcut."
msgstr ""
"Da biste uklonili prečicu, odaberite ga s popisa, a zatim kliknite na ikonu "
"za uklanjanje (crnu strijelicu sa iksom) desno od tipke koja vam omogućuje "
"da odaberete prečicu."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Working with Schemes</title>"
msgstr "<title>Rad sa šemama</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:307
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Schemes are keyboard shortcuts configuration profiles, so you can create "
"several profiles with different shortcuts and switch between these profiles "
"easily."
msgstr ""
"Sheme su konfiguracije profila prečica tipkovnice, tako da možete napraviti "
"više profila s različitim prečicama i lahko prebacivati između tih profila."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This feature is under development. It is not possible to import schemes "
"using a &GUI; at this time."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija je u razvoju. Nije moguće uvesti sheme koristeći &GUI; u ovom "
"trenutku."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: config.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Working with Schemes</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Rad sa šemama</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: config.docbook:318
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Customize Shortcuts window displaying the scheme editing tools."
msgstr "Prilagodba Prečice prozor prikazuje shemu alata za uređivanje."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing a scheme called <userinput>work</userinput>."
msgstr "Uređivanje šeme koja se zove <userinput>rad</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To see a menu allowing you to edit schemes, click on the <guibutton>Details</"
"guibutton> button at the bottom of the form. The following options will "
"appear:"
msgstr ""
"Da biste vidjeli izbornik koji vam omogućava da uredite sheme, kliknite na "
"<guibutton>Detalji</guibutton> dugme na dnu obrasca. Sljedeće mogućnosti će "
"se pojaviti:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: config.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid "Current Scheme"
msgstr "Trenutna šema"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allows you to switch between your schemes."
msgstr "Omogućava vam da se prebacite između šema."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: config.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid "New..."
msgstr "Nova..."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Creates a new scheme. This opens a window that lets you select a name for "
"your new scheme."
msgstr ""
"Pravi novu šemu. Također otvara prozor koji vam omogućava da odaberete ime "
"za svoju novu šemu."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: config.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Obriši"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deletes the current scheme."
msgstr "Briše trenutnu šemu."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: config.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid "More Actions"
msgstr "Više radnji"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens the following menu:"
msgstr "Ovara sljedeći izbornik:"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: config.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save as Scheme Defaults"
msgstr "Sačuvaj kao podrazumijevano za šeme"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the current scheme as the default for all new schemes."
msgstr "Postavlja trenutne šeme kao početno za sve nove šeme."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: config.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid "Export Scheme..."
msgstr "Izvezi šemu..."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Exports the current scheme to a file named "
"<filename><replaceable>applicationname</replaceable><replaceable>schemename</"
"replaceable>shortcuts.rc</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Izvozi trenutnu šemu u datoteku po imenu "
"<filename><replaceable>nazivaplikacije</replaceable><replaceable>schemename</"
"replaceable>prečice.rc</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:360
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Move this file to the folder <filename class=\"directory\">$KDEDIR/apps/"
"applicationname/</filename> and the exported scheme will be available in the "
"drop down box labelled <guilabel>Current Scheme</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"Pomaknite ovu datoteku u folder <filename class=\"directory\">$KDEDIR/apps/"
"applicationname/</filename> a izvozena šema će biti dostupna u ispuštajućoj "
"kutiji označenoj <guilabel>Trenutna šema</guilabel>"

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid "Printing Shortcuts"
msgstr "Ispisivanje Prečica"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:376
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can print out a list of shortcuts for easy reference by clicking the "
"<guibutton>Print</guibutton> button at the bottom of the window."
msgstr ""
"Možete ispisati popis prečica za jednostavno snalaženje klikom na "
"<guibutton>Ispiši</guibutton> na dnu prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Special thanks to Google Code-In 2011 participant Alexey Subach for writing "
"much of this section."
msgstr ""
"Posebne zahvale Google Code-In 2011 učesniku Alexey Subach za pisanje "
"velikog dijela ove selekcije."
